    "title" : "Hikari House, Niseko Hirafu - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1729336595866\" id=\"item-67133ee86841c06142dc4786\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-92b3b0adae7e2fccc318\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">About Us:<br>Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Discover modern sophistication in the heart of Niseko's prestigious Hirafu village with the newly built Hikari Townhouse. Completed in 2021, this property offers a perfect blend of luxury and comfort, designed for those seeking a stylish yet practical mountain retreat.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;transparentBackground&quot;:false,&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:false,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6713a5530baebe20f766a95d&quot;,&quot;controls&quot;:true,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;slideshow&quot;,&quot;meta-position&quot;:&quot;bottom&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-on-hover&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails&quot;:false,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6713a5530baebe20f766a95d&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729340369426_8293\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-slideshow\n  \n  \n  sqs-gallery-has-controls\n  \n\n  \n  sqs-gallery-block-show-meta\n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n\n        \n          \n            <div class=\"slide content-fit\" data-type=\"image\" data-click-through-url=\"\">\n              \n                <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729340757337-UE9UN73MI7X9FG2OFOLK/niseko+real+estate+floorplan+photographer+japan.jpg\" alt=\"niseko real estate floorplan photographer japan.jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-slideshow\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729340757337-UE9UN73MI7X9FG2OFOLK/niseko+real+estate+floorplan+photographer+japan.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729340757337-UE9UN73MI7X9FG2OFOLK/niseko+real+estate+floorplan+photographer+japan.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1600x900\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"niseko real estate floorplan photographer japan.jpg\" data-load=\"false\" data-image-id=\"6713a5544142eb29c6ec6dcd\" data-type=\"image\" />\n              \n\n              \n              <div class=\"color-overlay\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n          \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n      \n\n        \n          \n            <div class=\"slide content-fit\" data-type=\"image\" data-click-through-url=\"\">\n              \n                <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729340756731-3KW9AE6GJXS9C75APYM4/niseko+real+estate+floorplan+japan.jpg\" alt=\"niseko real estate floorplan japan.jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-slideshow\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729340756731-3KW9AE6GJXS9C75APYM4/niseko+real+estate+floorplan+japan.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729340756731-3KW9AE6GJXS9C75APYM4/niseko+real+estate+floorplan+japan.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1600x900\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"niseko real estate floorplan japan.jpg\" data-load=\"false\" data-image-id=\"6713a5547fe32942f5709f1d\" data-type=\"image\" />\n              \n\n              \n              <div class=\"color-overlay\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n          \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n      \n    \n  </div>\n\n  \n    <div class=\"sqs-gallery-meta-container\">\n    \n    \n      \n      \n        <div class=\"sqs-gallery-controls\">\n          <a\n            tabindex=\"0\"\n            role=\"button\"\n            class=\"previous\"\n            aria-label=\"Previous Slide\"\n          ></a>\n          <a\n            tabindex=\"0\"\n            role=\"button\"\n            class=\"next\"\n            aria-label=\"Next Slide\"\n          ></a>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n    \n    </div> <!-- END .sqs-gallery-meta-container -->\n  \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729340369426_8362\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Interior Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> 4 (2 in each unit), featuring sleek design and natural light, ensuring a restful environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> 4 (2 in each unit), each meticulously finished with contemporary fittings and clean lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Areas:</strong> 2 (1 in each unit), spacious and open plan, with high ceilings and modern decor, ideal for relaxation or entertaining guests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen:</strong><br>Each unit includes a state-of-the-art kitchen with premium appliances, ample storage, and a central island that doubles as a breakfast bar, perfect for casual dining.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Additional Amenities:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Parking:</strong> Off-street parking available, accommodating multiple vehicles conveniently.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Views:</strong> Large windows and strategically placed seating areas provide stunning views of the surrounding landscapes, making it a picturesque setting year-round.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Exterior and Community Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Architecture:</strong> Modern architectural design with a mix of wood and metal elements, complemented by expansive glass windows that integrate indoor and outdoor living.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Location:</strong> Positioned in a prime spot within Hirafu, residents have easy access to local ski resorts, fine dining, and entertainment, making it an excellent choice for seasonal visitors or year-round residents.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Ideal for:</strong><br>Those looking for a contemporary and luxurious lifestyle in one of Japan\u2019s most coveted winter destinations. Perfect for families or groups seeking a dual living arrangement with all the modern conveniences at their doorstep.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hikari Townhouse is not just a place to live; it's a lifestyle, offering a unique opportunity to own a part of Niseko\u2019s vibrant community with the promise of an unparalleled living experience.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;671394dd4142eb29c6ea075a&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;671394dd4142eb29c6ea075a&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729313965672_31209\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"671394de81ffa10d72e76d4f\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729336544735-XOYRJISQYEW4QGDR2TJ3/niseko+japan+real+estate+photographer+32.jpg\" alt=\"niseko japan real estate photographer 32.jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" da